From 19f6e0ac52c1a39e7981f0f3f15da620f4d2bee1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marius Gripsgard <marius@ubports.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:09:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Vendor the Launcher API headers instead of depending on
 lomiri-api

lomiri is the only implementer and consumer of lomiri-shell-launcher,
so there's no value in fetching those interface headers from a
separate API package at build time. The headers move into
include/lomiri/shell/launcher/ here; the CMakeLists.txt files that
referenced them via the old LAUNCHER_API_INCLUDEDIR pkg-config
variable (for AUTOMOC's header list) now point at the local copy
instead. lomiri-api drops its copy in a companion commit.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |   1 -
 .../shell/launcher/AppDrawerModelInterface.h  |  71 +++++++
 .../shell/launcher/LauncherItemInterface.h    | 185 ++++++++++++++++
 .../shell/launcher/LauncherModelInterface.h   | 198 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../shell/launcher/QuickListModelInterface.h  |  94 +++++++++
 .../Greeter/Lomiri/Launcher/CMakeLists.txt    |   6 +-
 plugins/Lomiri/Launcher/CMakeLists.txt        |   8 +-
 plugins/Utils/CMakeLists.txt                  |   6 +-
 tests/mocks/Lomiri/Launcher/CMakeLists.txt    |   8 +-
 tests/mocks/Utils/CMakeLists.txt              |   8 +-
 .../Greeter/Lomiri/Launcher/CMakeLists.txt    |   8 +-
 tests/plugins/Lomiri/Launcher/CMakeLists.txt  |  14 +-
 12 files changed, 577 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/lomiri/shell/launcher/AppDrawerModelInterface.h
 create mode 100644 include/lomiri/shell/launcher/LauncherItemInterface.h
 create mode 100644 include/lomiri/shell/launcher/LauncherModelInterface.h
 create mode 100644 include/lomiri/shell/launcher/QuickListModelInterface.h

