From 87343bc2c3a396879a77d8e6c18458a271f85a4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marius Gripsgard <marius@ubports.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 03:03:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Launcher headers: drop the inert
 LOMIRI_API/SymbolExport.h

LOMIRI_API only expands to a visibility attribute when
LOMIRI_DLL_EXPORTS is defined, and that's only defined while building
lomiri-api's own liblomiri-api.so. lomiri never defines it, so the
macro has always expanded to nothing here, and SymbolExport.h was the
one thing keeping these headers from being fully self-contained.
